# Infrastructure

- Server scripts: `infra/` only (ops.sh, server-bootstrap.sh)
- Prod compose: `docker-compose.prod.yml` — app + db + adminer + migrate
- Dev compose: `docker-compose.yml` — postgres only
- Deploy: `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` — push main
- Rollback: `.github/workflows/rollback.yml` — manual dispatch
- Server path: `/opt/dolinaznaniy`, env: `/opt/dolinaznaniy/.env`
- Shell scripts: LF line endings (Unix)
- Do not put app business logic in infra/
